Load this weekend's FP1/FP2/FP3/SQ/S/Q classifications (single-race path).

The practice/sprint sessions are passed through the optional driver mask;
quali (Q) is never masked.  Returns (fp1, fp2, fp3, sq, sprint_race, quali).

Select the actual-results dict for the configured ``actual_source``.

"quali" uses SQ on sprint weekends (else Q); "quali_q_only" always uses Q;
"race" (default) uses the race classification.

Assemble one constructor's pre-normalization pace/dispersion raw fields.

Pure tuple-unpacking / field-mapping over the per-bucket pooled feature dicts;
no behaviour or feature values differ from the inline construction.

Construct one ConstructorFeatures bundle from normalized fields + diagnostics.

Pure field-mapping over the normalized columns and per-bucket support tuples;
no behaviour or feature values differ from the inline construction.

Call ``runtime.predict`` with the oracle state coerced to the runtime contract.

Mapping-typed oracle grid/lap-N positions and an int target lap pass through;
anything else collapses to ``None`` (the runtime's no-oracle signal).
